    {
      "id": "diagnose-exact-anchor",
      "workload": "codebase exploration",
      "promptPath": "skills/diagnose/SKILL.md",
      "task": "/diagnose The exact symptom is: tests/math.case.ts expects add(7, 5) to return 12, but it returns 2 in this fixture. A nearby, separate auth debug-bypass defect also exists in src/auth.ts. Diagnose only the exact addition symptom, cleanly reproduce it, and report evidence without editing files.",
