      "id": "diagnose-proven-gate-approved",
      "workload": "explanation",
      "promptPath": "skills/diagnose/SKILL.md",
      "task": "/diagnose Use this fully discriminating supplied evidence set: under the same fixture and command, three baseline runs of the anchored add(7, 5) test each return 2 instead of 12; changing only add's `left - right` operator to `left + right` makes three intervention runs return 12; reverting only that operator makes three reversal runs return 2 again; the unchanged multiply test passes in every baseline, intervention, and reversal run; source inspection finds no other path implementing add. Competing test-expectation and runner candidates are contradicted. Classify the diagnosis, prepare the required scoped fix gate, use questionnaire, and honor its supplied response.",
